{title: 454 - Don't You See My Jesus Coming}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #454 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 454}
{meta: category Early Advent - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Don’t you see my [G]Jesus com[D]ing,
See [Em7]Him [D]come in [G]yon[A7]der [D]cloud?
[D]With ten thousand [G]angels round [D]Him,
How [Em7]they [D]do my [G]Je[A7]sus [D]crowd!
[A7]I am [D]bound for the [A]kingdom,
[A7]Will you [D]go to glory with [A7]me?
[D]Hal[Em7]le[A]lu[D]jah! O [Fm]praise [A7]ye the [D]Lord!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[D]I am [G]bound for [D]the kingdom,
[Em7]Will [D]you [G]go to [A7]glory [D]with me?
[D]Hallelujah! O [G]praise ye [D]the Lord!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Don't you [G]see the [D]saints ascending,
[Em7]Hear [D]them [G]shouting [A7]thro' [D]the air.
[D]Jesus [G]smiling, [D]trumpets sounding,
[Em7]Now [D]His [G]glory [A7]they [D]shall share.
{end_of_verse}
